   "dur": 4.05,
   "speech": "我们的结构是六十、三十二、一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 444.82,
   "dur": 3.23,
   "speech": "输入是六十个数，一个窗口。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 448.6,
   "dur": 2.75,
   "speech": "中间三十二个隐单元。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 451.9,
   "dur": 3.21,
   "speech": "输出一个数，下一期的收益率。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 455.66,
   "dur": 4.05,
   "speech": "第一层，每个输出都看全部六十个输入。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 460.25,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speech": "第二层，每个输出都看全部三十二个隐单元。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 465.28,
   "dur": 2.7,
   "speech": "没有共享，没有局部性。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 468.53,
   "dur": 4.91,
   "speech": "第 k 个输入和第 k 加 1 个输入，地位完全一样。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 473.99,
   "dur": 4.12,
   "speech": "你把窗口顺序打乱，它就学成另一个模型。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 478.66,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "这就是「时间相邻」没被写进结构。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 482.75,
   "dur": 2.34,
   "speech": "再说时间卷积。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 485.65,
   "dur": 2.82,
   "speech": "它的核只有三个权重。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 489.02,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speech": "在时间轴上滑，每个位置都用同一组权重。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 493.81,
   "dur": 2.34,
   "speech": "这叫权重共享。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 496.7,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "所以参数量不随序列长度涨。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 500.91,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "膨胀系数，是让核跳着看。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 504.55,
   "dur": 3.13,
   "speech": "膨胀等于一，看相邻三步。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 508.23,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "膨胀等于二，中间隔一格。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 511.94,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speech": "膨胀等于四，中间隔三格。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 515.79,
   "dur": 3.4,
   "speech": "三层叠起来，膨胀一到二到四。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 519.74,
   "dur": 3.49,
   "speech": "最后一层的感受野，是十五步。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 523.78,
   "dur": 2.13,
   "speech": "这个数怎么来的？"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 526.46,
   "dur": 5.25,
   "speech": "一层膨胀 d，核长 K，多看出 K 减一乘 d 步。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 532.25,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speech": "三层加起来，一加二加四等于七。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 536.56,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "七乘二，再加一，等于十五。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 540.56,
   "dur": 4.57,
   "speech": "所以公式是，一加 K 减一乘以膨胀之和。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 545.68,
   "dur": 2.44,
   "speech": "书里没给这个公式。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 548.67,
   "dur": 3.83,
   "speech": "它是标准做法，标注为本仓推导。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 553.05,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speech": "再看因果性。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 555.68,
   "dur": 4.55,
   "speech": "左补 K 减一乘 d 个零，输出和输入一样长。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 560.78,
   "dur": 4.43,
   "speech": "补零的个数写死，错一位整条线就平移。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 565.76,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speech": "第 t 个输出，只用到第 t 步和更早的输入。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 570.79,
   "dur": 3.11,
   "speech": "所以它永远看不见未来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 40,
   "start": 574.45,
   "dur": 4.45,
   "speech": "三个东西，三层、膨胀、因果补零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 41,
   "start": 579.45,
   "dur": 3.47,
   "speech": "合起来，才叫因果膨胀卷积。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 42,
   "start": 583.47,
   "dur": 2.65,
   "speech": "少一个，性质就没了。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 43,
   "start": 586.67,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speech": "最后说训练。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 44,
   "start": 589.3,
   "dur": 2.65,
   "speech": "书里没有训练配方。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 45,
   "start": 592.51,
   "dur": 4.98,
   "speech": "优化器、学习率、批大小、早停，全都没写。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 46,
   "start": 598.04,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "我们的选择不是书里给的，写进自查表。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 47,
   "start": 602.66,
   "dur": 4.17,
   "speech": "这一集用的每一行超参，都能在计划里查到。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 610.22,
   "dur": 2.7,
   "speech": "这一节把符号钉死。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 613.47,
   "dur": 1.72,
   "speech": "先说层。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 615.74,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "第 l 层的输入，是上一层的输出。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 619.86,
   "dur": 4.77,
   "speech": "权重是一个矩阵，行是输出维，列是输入维。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 625.17,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "偏置是一个向量，每个输出一个。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 629.29,
   "dur": 3.97,
   "speech": "z 是线性部分，h 是激活之后的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 633.81,
   "dur": 4.98,
   "speech": "书里式二点四六，z 等于 W 乘 h 加 b。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 639.34,
   "dur": 3.97,
   "speech": "式二点四七，h 等于 phi 作用于 z。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 643.87,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "phi 是激活函数，我们选 tanh。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 647.67,
   "dur": 3.35,
   "speech": "输出层不套激活，直接线性。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 651.57,
   "dur": 2.73,
   "speech": "这样输出的范围不受限。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 654.85,
   "dur": 2.49,
   "speech": "损失用均方误差。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 657.88,
   "dur": 2.75,
   "speech": "不除二，也不除批大小。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 661.18,
   "dur": 4.43,
   "speech": "这两个常数只影响学习率，不影响最优点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 666.16,
   "dur": 2.34,
   "speech": "初始化用 Xavier。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 669.06,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speech": "标准差是根号下二除以扇入加扇出。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 673.84,
   "dur": 2.25,
   "speech": "优化器用 Adam。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 676.64,
   "dur": 5.65,
   "speech": "学习率千分之一，两个衰减系数零点九和零点九九九。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 682.84,
   "dur": 3.85,
   "speech": "批大小六十四，最多跑若干轮。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 687.25,
   "dur": 2.65,
   "speech": "早停的耐心是五轮。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 690.45,
   "dur": 3.61,
   "speech": "连续五轮验证损失不降，就停。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 694.62,
   "dur": 1.93,
   "speech": "再说卷积。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 697.1,
   "dur": 4.19,
   "speech": "一维因果卷积，核是长度为 K 的向量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 701.84,
   "dur": 4.79,
   "speech": "式二点六二，输出在 t 点等于核和输入的点积。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 707.18,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speech": "下标 t 减 K 加 k，前面已经说过，是翻转。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 712.21,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speech": "膨胀版本，式二点六三。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 715.8,
   "dur": 2.58,
   "speech": "下标里多乘一个 d。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 718.93,
   "dur": 6.3,
   "speech": "意思是，核的第 k 个权重，看的是第 t 减 K 加 k 乘 d 步。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 725.78,
   "dur": 3.33,
   "speech": "相邻两个权重之间，隔了 d 步。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 729.66,
   "dur": 4.09,
   "speech": "所以膨胀不增加参数，只增加视野。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 734.3,
   "dur": 2.13,
   "speech": "参数量怎么算？"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 736.98,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "一层卷积的权重，是三样相乘。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 741.21,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "核长、输入通道、输出通道。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 745.14,
   "dur": 2.68,
   "speech": "再加输出通道个偏置。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 748.36,
   "dur": 4.67,
   "speech": "全连接层，是输入维乘输出维，再加输出维。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 753.58,
   "dur": 5.15,
   "speech": "多层感知机六十到三十二到一，是一千九百八十五。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 759.28,
   "dur": 5.01,
   "speech": "时间卷积三层加一个输出头，是一千六百四十九。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 764.84,
   "dur": 4,
   "speech": "这两个数，测试里各有一条断言钉住。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 769.39,
   "dur": 2.27,
   "speech": "最后是感受野。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 772.21,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "一加 K 减一，乘以膨胀系数之和。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 40,
   "start": 776.44,
   "dur": 4.41,
   "speech": "本集配置，三减一等于二，膨胀和是七。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 41,
   "start": 781.4,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "所以是一加十四，等于十五。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 42,
   "start": 785.32,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speech": "这四个符号，W、b、phi、K、d，后面反复用。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 43,
   "start": 792.27,
   "dur": 2.39,
   "speech": "现在可以看实现了。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 798.06,
   "dur": 5.37,
   "speech": "实现分三块：多层感知机、卷积、共同的训练循环。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 803.98,
   "dur": 2.53,
   "speech": "先说多层感知机。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 807.06,
   "dur": 5.13,
   "speech": "参数按层存，每层一个权重矩阵、一个偏置向量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 812.74,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speech": "前向就是循环，逐层算 z，再算 h。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 817.76,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speech": "反向也手写。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 820.39,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "从损失对输出的导数开始。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 824.1,
   "dur": 4.38,
   "speech": "输出层是线性的，导数就是二倍的残差。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 829.03,
   "dur": 2.77,
   "speech": "然后一轮一轮往前推。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 832.36,
   "dur": 5.63,
   "speech": "每层的 delta，是上一层 delta 乘权重，再乘激活的导数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 838.54,
   "dur": 3.4,
   "speech": "tanh 的导数是，一减 tanh 的平方。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 842.48,
   "dur": 3.49,
   "speech": "梯度就是 delta 乘上一层的输入。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 846.53,
   "dur": 3.06,
   "speech": "权重和偏置分开累加。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 850.14,
   "dur": 3.33,
   "speech": "写完之后，一定要做梯度检查。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 854.02,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "用中心差分，步长十的负六次方。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 858.25,
   "dur": 5.37,
   "speech": "解析梯度和数值梯度，相对误差要小于十的负六次方。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 864.17,
   "dur": 4.12,
   "speech": "我们第一次跑，相对误差是一点九五七。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 868.84,
   "dur": 2.22,
   "speech": "一看就是错的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 871.61,
   "dur": 2.15,
   "speech": "原因有两个。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 874.31,
   "dur": 4.19,
   "speech": "一是循环把输入层的 delta 也算进去了。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 879.05,
   "dur": 3.33,
   "speech": "二是取梯度的时候，层序反了。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 882.92,
   "dur": 4.57,
   "speech": "修完之后，误差降到三点零六乘十的负十次方。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 888.05,
   "dur": 3.85,
   "speech": "这一条，是整集最值得抄走的方法。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 892.45,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speech": "先说单层过了，再查多层。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 896.28,
   "dur": 4.65,
   "speech": "单层对、多层错，问题一定在层间传递。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 901.48,
   "dur": 1.93,
   "speech": "再说卷积。"
  },
  {
