  {
   "scene": "boundary",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 1410.51,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speech": "停牌不是缺失，是没有交易日。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "boundary",
   "index": 40,
   "start": 1414.34,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "所以窗口是按行取的，不是按日历。"
